1. CORE ARCHITECTURE

Use a production-grade modular architecture.

Separate the application into:

- Flutter UI
- Application/business layer
- Local database
- Music indexing engine
- Metadata engine
- Lyrics engine
- Playlist engine
- Audio engine interface
- Android native audio module
- iOS native audio module
- Offline intelligence engine
- Audio analysis engine
- DJ engine
- Backup/restore
